    "pali": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, vipassī kumāro bahūnaṁ vassānaṁ …pe…",
    "english": "Then, after many thousand years had passed, Prince Vipassī had his charioteer drive him to the park once more.",
    "translator": "Bhikkhu Sujato",
    "title_pi": "Mahāpadānasutta",
    "title_en": "The Great Discourse on Traces Left Behind",
    "license": "CC0-1.0"
